"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":1860,"text":"Kanban Board","textSize":64,"textBold":true,"textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mm7Nb-wae-310O2Z9gZhu"},{"id":"ZoaL7KWVw7oMYKA2n5a_a","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4770},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Facilitation guide","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NLH1vgeTfZ4zUnPnUuIfq","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"oJQK2e-014fVfZOThrlnX","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":4940},"width":1680,"height":1060,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Kanban Board: How it works in 4 steps\n\n🎯 Purpose: Make work visible, limit work in progress and keep tasks flowing to Done.\n\n1. Fill the backlog (10 min)\nAction: Write every task on its own card and place it in \"To do\".\nRule: One task per card, phrased as an action (\"Update price list\").\n\n2. Agree on colours and limits (5 min)\nAction: Assign each card colour a meaning (e.g. feature, bug, admin).\nRule: Set a maximum number of cards for \"In Progress\" (e.g. 3 per person).\n\n3. Pull work (ongoing)\nAction: Whoever starts a task moves the card to \"In Progress\" and adds their name.\nRule: Only pull new work when the limit allows it.\n\n4. Finish and review (weekly)\nAction: Move finished cards to \"Done\" and look at what got stuck and why.\nGoal: Learn where the flow slows down.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nFlow keeper: In short stand-ups, walk the board from right to left: what is almost done?\nLimit guard: Point out when \"In Progress\" overflows.\nHousekeeper: Archive old \"Done\" cards regularly.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NLH1vgeTfZ4zUnPnUuIfq","textSize":28,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"_d8zvrAIbPTnPiN_6ADW1","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4770},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T03 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mx8-Vo-4kvA25HdDCTDKf","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"Op1SIaVcXSOaRBAP7fCrS","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4910},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T03   ·   Datei: T03_kanban-board.en.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Schnellstart_Paket.nwb (= Schnellstart_Templates.nwb) › Rahmen 2\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mx8-Vo-4kvA25HdDCTDKf","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"B8HmSCRJt2QwvzIQWFswD","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5060},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mx8-Vo-4kvA25HdDCTDKf","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"DufG7px6hIHMKlR0CX_E8","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5060},"width":690,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Vorschlag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mx8-Vo-4kvA25HdDCTDKf","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"Wd8ARBc4xbxwin0kPZAxY","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5060},"width":760,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Ihr Eintrag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mx8-Vo-4kvA25HdDCTDKf","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"WDkN3l3oMCuo_L2GfSe-J","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5128},"width":430,"height":93,"fillColor":"#d7dee2","text":"Veröffentlichen?\n[publish]","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Mx8-Vo-4kvA25HdDCTDKf","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"PEHiZRPJ_wUzlrk9ZxFJF","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y"